        rdfs:comment                   "Riding hat, probably for a child, black beaver with red silk and gimp lining, a velvet band with bow and steel buckle, and tying strings of picot edged ribbon. There is a piped wired band inserted into the brim’s rim to support the shape. Made in England, 1860-1870"@en , "Riding hat, probably for a child. Black beaver lined with red silk and gimp, a black velvet band at the front has a bow and steel buckle. There are tying strings of black picot edged ribbon."@en ;
